// MISTAKE: a typo in the name of an address. `jordan` fills a slot of a 401(k), so `jordan/40lk` is read as an
// address and not taken for a new party, and no account of Jordan's is called `40lk`.
base USD
use std
use us/401k

entity chase : org
entity fidelity : org
entity bluefin : employer
entity jordan : person
entity family : household

account family/checking : deposit at chase
account jordan/bluefin/401k at fidelity

opening 2026-01-01
  family/checking 1_000 USD
  jordan/bluefin/401k 5_000 USD

2026-01-31 jordan/40lk = 5_000 USD
